1
00:00:02,042 --> 00:00:07,402
Once upon a time, in a small village, there lived a kind old man named Geppetto.

2
00:00:07,875 --> 00:00:09,995
He loved making wooden toys.

3
00:00:10,458 --> 00:00:14,258
But sometimes, his little house felt very quiet.

4
00:00:15,417 --> 00:00:17,617
Look at you, little wooden boy!

5
00:00:18,083 --> 00:00:22,803
You have two arms, two legs, and a funny little nose.

6
00:00:23,292 --> 00:00:25,412
I'll call you Pinocchio.

7
00:00:29,708 --> 00:00:33,028
That night, a beautiful blue light floated through the window.

8
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,080
Good evening, Geppetto.

9
00:00:38,625 --> 00:00:41,565
You made this little boy with so much love.

10
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:43,782
Let me give him a little magic.

11
00:00:44,625 --> 00:00:46,745
Oh! A real fairy?

12
00:00:47,208 --> 00:00:49,768
Can he really come alive?

13
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,630
Watch closely.

14
00:00:55,792 --> 00:00:58,112
Wait! Did his fingers move?

15
00:00:58,583 --> 00:01:01,023
Yoonsu, look at his hands!

16
00:01:01,792 --> 00:01:03,152
What is happening?

17
00:01:15,167 --> 00:01:15,967
Oh!

18
00:01:16,458 --> 00:01:17,578
I can move!

19
00:01:18,042 --> 00:01:19,242
I can see you!

20
00:01:19,708 --> 00:01:22,508
Pinocchio! You're alive!

21
00:01:26,708 --> 00:01:28,968
Welcome to the world, Pinocchio.

22
00:01:29,458 --> 00:01:31,958
Remember to be kind and tell the truth.

23
00:01:32,417 --> 00:01:33,337
The truth?

24
00:01:33,833 --> 00:01:36,533
Yes. The truth is very important.

25
00:01:40,875 --> 00:01:43,555
The little wooden boy had so much to learn.

26
00:01:44,042 --> 00:01:46,122
And his adventure was just beginning.
